# 1.Purr Data Modules

To use the respective modules, you must open a new patch in plugData and call each of the objects from the following list:
The pethes receive data from the App Sensor2OSC  https://sensors2.org/osc/
---

## Available Modules List

* `acelamart.pd`
* `girosmart.pd`
* `mluz.pd`
* `extsensor.pd`
* `moduloEX2.pd`
* `acelinesmart.pd`
* `magnet.pd`
* `mprox.pd`
* `smartouch.pd`
* `vectrot.pd`
* `oscmodule.pd`

